    {
      "id": "2026-10-11-s1",
      "level": 1,
      "topic": "daily life",
      "title_zh": "女儿病了",
      "title_en": "My daughter is ill",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["今天", "，", "我", "的", "女儿", "病", "了", "。", "她", "什么", "都", "不", "想", "吃", "，", "也", "不", "想", "起来", "。"],
        ["我", "就", "和", "她", "去", "医院", "。", "医生", "看", "了", "看", "，", "说", "：", "“", "不", "重", "，", "回家", "睡", "一", "天", "就", "好", "了", "。", "”"],
        ["回家", "后", "，", "她", "睡", "了", "四", "个", "小时", "。", "我", "也", "在", "家", "，", "没有", "去", "工作", "。"],
        ["晚上", "，", "她", "起来", "说", "：", "“", "我", "想", "吃", "东西", "！", "”"],
        ["我", "笑", "了", "。", "她", "好", "了", "！"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "Today my daughter got ill. She didn’t want to eat anything, or even get up.",
        "So I took her to the hospital. The doctor had a look and said: “It’s not serious. Go home and sleep for a day and she’ll be fine.”",
        "When we got home, she slept for four hours. I stayed home too and didn’t go to work.",
        "In the evening she got up and said: “I want something to eat!”",
        "I smiled. She was better!"
      ],
      "names": [],
      "new_words": ["女儿", "病", "医生"],
      "glossary": [
        { "word": "女儿", "english": "daughter" },
        { "word": "病", "english": "to be ill; illness" },
        { "word": "医生", "english": "doctor" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-10-11-s2",
      "level": 1,
      "topic": "anime",
      "title_zh": "我会唱了",
      "title_en": "Now I can sing it",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["今年", "我", "很", "喜欢", "一", "个", "日本", "的", "电影", "。", "电影", "里", "的", "歌", "我", "也", "很", "喜欢", "。"],
        ["我", "在", "手机", "上", "听", "了", "很", "多", "次", "。", "现在", "，", "我", "也", "会", "唱", "了", "！"],
        ["晚上", "我", "在", "家", "唱", "。", "妈妈", "问", "：", "“", "这", "是", "什么", "歌", "？", "”"],
        ["我", "说", "：", "“", "是", "日本", "电影", "里", "的", "歌", "！", "我", "最", "喜欢", "这", "个", "。", "”"],
        ["妈妈", "笑", "着", "说", "：", "“", "真", "好", "！", "我", "还", "想", "听", "！", "”"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "This year I've really liked a Japanese film. I really like the song in it too.",
        "I've listened to it lots of times on my phone. Now I can sing it too!",
        "In the evening I sang it at home. Mum asked: “What song is that?”",
        "I said: “It’s a song from a Japanese film! It’s my favourite.”",
        "Mum smiled and said: “Lovely! I want to hear more!”"
      ],
      "names": ["日本"],
      "new_words": ["今年", "手机", "唱"],
      "glossary": [
        { "word": "今年", "english": "this year" },
        { "word": "手机", "english": "mobile phone" },
        { "word": "唱", "english": "to sing" },
        { "word": "日本", "english": "Japan" }
      ]
    }
